          <div class="md-stat__label">API call to get a QR image</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-6 col-md-3 md-stat">
          <div class="md-stat__num">∞</div>
          <div class="md-stat__label">free forever, no rate-wall</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
      <div class="md-section-header text-center fade-up delay-1">Why QR Codify</div>
      <div class="row g-3">
        <article class="col-md-6 col-xl-3 fade-up delay-1">
          <div class="md-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="md-icon-avatar"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">lock</span></div>
            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold text-white mb-2">Private by design</h2>
            <p class="small mb-0" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.65;">Your URLs and text are
              processed in-memory and discarded immediately. Nothing is logged, stored, or sold. Ever.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="col-md-6 col-xl-3 fade-up delay-2">
          <div class="md-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="md-icon-avatar icon-avatar--tertiary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">bolt</span></div>
            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold text-white mb-2">Instant generation</h2>
            <p class="small mb-0" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.65;">Server-side canvas rendering
              delivers a crisp PNG in milliseconds — no third-party QR service, no redirects.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="col-md-6 col-xl-3 fade-up delay-3">
          <div class="md-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="md-icon-avatar"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">palette</span></div>
            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold text-white mb-2">Themed visuals</h2>
            <p class="small mb-0" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.65;">Cyber gradient, Tokyo Night,
              Neon Lime and Glitch Matrix — custom finder patterns and gradient fills that actually look good.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="col-md-6 col-xl-3 fade-up delay-4">
          <div class="md-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="md-icon-avatar icon-avatar--success"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">terminal</span></div>
            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold text-white mb-2">Developer first API</h2>
            <p class="small mb-0" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.65;">One GET or POST to <code
                style="color:var(--md-primary);">/api/generate</code> returns a PNG. Pass <code
                style="color:var(--md-primary);">data</code>, <code style="color:var(--md-primary);">theme</code>, <code
                style="color:var(--md-primary);">size</code> — done.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="md-surface md-surface--elevated p-3 p-sm-4 p-md-5 mb-4 fade-up delay-2">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center text-lg-start">
          <div class="md-section-header">Privacy promise</div>
          <h2 class="h3 md-headline text-white mb-3">We see nothing.<br>We store nothing.</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.7;" class="mb-3">
            When you generate a QR code, your input passes directly into the rendering engine and is discarded the
            instant the image is sent back. There is no database, no analytics pipeline, no session cookie, and no user
            account.
          </p>
          <p style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.7;" class="mb-0">
            You can verify this yourself — the full source is on GitHub. Self-hosting takes a single <code
              style="color:var(--md-tertiary);">node .</code> command.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="row g-2 g-sm-3">
            <div class="col-6">
              <div class="privacy-mini" style="--privacy-accent: var(--md-primary);">
                <div class="privacy-mini__icon privacy-mini__icon--primary">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined">visibility_off</span>
                </div>
                <div class="privacy-mini__title">No tracking</div>
                <p class="privacy-mini__desc">No analytics or fingerprinting</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6">
              <div class="privacy-mini" style="--privacy-accent: var(--md-tertiary);">
                <div class="privacy-mini__icon privacy-mini__icon--tertiary">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined">storage</span>
                </div>
                <div class="privacy-mini__title">No database</div>
                <p class="privacy-mini__desc">Pure stateless API, zero persistence</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6">
              <div class="privacy-mini" style="--privacy-accent: var(--md-success);">
                <div class="privacy-mini__icon privacy-mini__icon--success">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined">cookie</span>
                </div>
                <div class="privacy-mini__title">No cookies</div>
                <p class="privacy-mini__desc">No session, no login wall</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6">
              <div class="privacy-mini" style="--privacy-accent: var(--md-warning);">
                <div class="privacy-mini__icon privacy-mini__icon--warning">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined">payments</span>
                </div>
                <div class="privacy-mini__title">No upsell</div>
                <p class="privacy-mini__desc">No premium tier, no ads. Ever.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="api-section" class="md-surface md-surface--elevated p-3 p-sm-4 p-md-5 mb-4 fade-up delay-3">
      <div class="row align-items-start g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-5 text-center text-lg-start">
          <div class="md-section-header">REST API</div>
          <h2 class="h4 md-headline text-white mb-2">Plug in, ship fast.</h2>
          <p class="small mb-3" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.72;">No auth tokens, no setup.
            Hit the endpoint and get a PNG. Works from any language or HTTP client.</p>
          <button id="openApiExampleBtn2" type="button"
            class="md-btn md-btn--tonal md-btn--sm md-btn--block w-lg-auto">
            See full example <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-7 w-100">
          <!-- GET /api/generate -->
          <div class="api-endpoint">
            <div class="api-endpoint__header">
              <div class="api-endpoint__method-path">
                <div class="api-endpoint__icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.9rem;">api</span></div>
                <span class="method m-get">GET</span>
                <code class="api-endpoint__endpoint-code">/api/generate?data=hello&theme=<%- previewTheme  %>&size=500x500&format=png</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__description">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.85rem;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px;">image</span>
              Returns image directly — use as an <code>&lt;img src&gt;</code>. Formats: <code>png</code>, <code>jpg</code>, <code>svg</code>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__return">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.8rem;">output</span>
              <span>PNG, JPG, or SVG</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- POST /api/generate -->
          <div class="api-endpoint">
            <div class="api-endpoint__header">
              <div class="api-endpoint__method-path">
                <div class="api-endpoint__icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.9rem;">api</span></div>
                <span class="method m-post">POST</span>
                <code class="api-endpoint__endpoint-code">/api/generate</code>
              </div>
              <span class="md-chip chip-tone-warning" style="font-size:.62rem;padding:3px 9px 3px 7px;"><%- rateLim %> req/min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__description">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.85rem;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px;">data_object</span>
              JSON body: <code>{ data, theme, size, format?, banner? }</code>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__return">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.8rem;">image</span>
              <span>PNG, JPG, or SVG Blob</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- POST /api/read -->
          <div class="api-endpoint">
            <div class="api-endpoint__header">
              <div class="api-endpoint__method-path">
                <div class="api-endpoint__icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.9rem;">api</span></div>
                <span class="method m-post">POST</span>
                <code class="api-endpoint__endpoint-code">/api/read</code>
              </div>
              <span class="md-chip chip-tone-warning" style="font-size:.62rem;padding:3px 9px 3px 7px;"><%- rateLim %> req/min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__description">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.85rem;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px;">data_object</span>
              JSON body: <code>{ image: "&lt;base64/binary/formdata&gt;" }</code>
            </div>
            <div class="api-endpoint__return">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:0.8rem;">qr_code_2</span>
              <span>Decoded QR Text</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="md-surface md-surface--elevated p-3 p-sm-4 p-md-5 mb-4 fade-up delay-4">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 text-center text-lg-start">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <div class="md-section-header">Open source</div>
          <h2 class="h4 md-headline text-white mb-2">Built in the open. Free forever.</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);line-height:1.7;" class="mb-3">
            QR Codify is fully open source. Read every line, report issues, suggest features, or self-host it on your
            own server in minutes. No enterprise tier. No gatekeeping.
          </p>
          <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-2 justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start">
            <a href="https://github.com/blazeinferno64/QR-Codify" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="md-btn md-btn--outlined md-btn--sm">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">star</span> Star on GitHub
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/blazeinferno64/QR-Codify" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="md-btn md-btn--tonal md-btn--sm">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">fork_right</span> Fork &amp; self-host
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 text-center">
          <div class="md-icon-avatar icon-avatar--warning mx-auto" style="width:64px;height:64px;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:2rem;">verified</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fw-bold text-white mb-1 mt-2">MIT Licensed</div>
          <div class="small" style="color:var(--md-on-surface-variant);">Use it, remix it, ship it.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

